# Blitzball: "GOOOOAAAALLL! - {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw two cards. Activate only if an opponent was dealt combat damage by a legendary
# creature this turn." On turn 3 it is refused before combat; after Isamaru (a legendary creature) is unblocked, the first Blitzball is
# sacrificed to draw two. On turn 5 Bot2's Ornithopter blocks Isamaru, no combat damage is dealt to the opponent, and the second
# Blitzball is refused again (it is a new turn, too).

